The '''Tomb Floodway''' is a [[Location]] found on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}}. It can be accessed through a passageway located towards the right side of the entrance to the {{Zone|Wyrmgrove Tomb}}.

== Features ==
While in the '''Tomb Floodway''', players gain {{Stat|Treasure Chance|+10}} and cannot fish up [[Sea Creatures]].

The '''Tomb Floodway''' is the only place where players can fish up {{Item|Flexbone}}s. These have a {{Green|25%}} chance to replace [[Treasure]] that's caught, with the amount gained depends on the tier of [[Treasure]] fished up:
{|class="wikitable ct"
! Tier
! Amount
|-
| {{Dark Purple|'''GOOD CATCH'''}}
| {{Green|1x}}
|-
| {{Gold|'''GREAT CATCH'''}}
| {{Green|2-4x}}
|-
| {{Pink|'''OUTSTANDING CATCH'''}}
| {{Green|8x}}
|}

The {{Attr|Flexible Fisher}} [[Attribute]], obtained from syphoning {{Item|Osedax Shard}}s, increases the chances of catching {{Item|Flexbone}}s by {{Green|+2.5}}-{{Green|25%}}.

